					"concentration": true
				}
			],
			"entries": [
				"For the duration of this spell, your fist gleams with silvery arcane light and you may, as an action, make a melee spell attack against a creature within reach of your unarmed attack. The first such successful attack during the duration of this spell deals {@damage 2d10} force damage to the target, and the target must make a Strength saving throw or be knocked {@condition prone} and pushed up to 5 feet away from you."
			],
			"entriesHigherLevel": [
				{
					"type": "entries",
					"name": "At Higher Levels",
					"entries": [
						"When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the extra damage increases by {@scaledamage 2d10|2-9|2d10} for each slot level above 1st. Additionally, the distance the target may be pushed away from you on a failed save increases by 5 feet for each slot level above 1st."
					]
				}
			],
